# speaker: Poshe
Helloooo there's mail for Chemy!

# speaker: Chemy
Mmm... coming...

# speaker: Poshe
Good morning! You must be Chemy, the new alchemist!

# speaker: Chemy
Morning! That's me. And you are?

# speaker: Poshe
I'm Poshe! I deliver the newspaper every morning.

# speaker: Poshe
Welcome to Wavecrest! Here's the Daily Tidals.

# speaker: Chemy
Daily Tidals?

# speaker: Poshe
Yep! Besides the daily news happening in all of A'ea, it also lists commision requests from the townspeople.

# speaker: Chemy
Oh? Interesting.

# speaker: Poshe
Please do some commision whenever you feel up to it. It would help out a ton! I'm sure everybody would appreciate it. 

# speaker: Poshe
I still have more newspapers to deliver. Have a great day, Chemy!

# speaker: Chemy
Thanks, Poshe. Have a safe trip!

# speaker: Poshe
Bye!

# speaker: Chemy
I should try help out around town. Let's see what's in today's paper...

